-- L2 回放链 ams8000-room-pane-chain：PANE 24381/35844 复位（上移 200 mm），链尾把工程还原。
-- 恰好一个 SAVEWORK；wrapper QUIT。SAVEWORK 之后拷一份库文件。
ONERROR CONTINUE
ALPHA LOG "D:/work/plant-code/old/gen-model/output/replay-record/room_pane_restore.log" OVER
$P PANE-RESTORE-ALIVE
=24381/35844
Q TYPE
Q NAME
Q REF
Q POS
BY U 200mm
Q POS
SAVEWORK 'replay chain ams8000-room-pane-chain: PANE =24381/35844 up 200mm (restore)'
$P PANE-RESTORE-SAVED
SYSCOM 'cmd /c copy /Y "E:\reverse\e3d\replay-src\E3D3.1\AvevaMarineSample\ams000\ams8000_0001" "D:\work\plant-code\old\gen-model\output\replay-record\snapshots-pane\ams8000_0001.after-restore-save"'
$P PANE-RESTORE-DONE
ALPHA LOG END
